{"id":"claramente","lemma":"claramente","pos":"adv","rank":1295,"glosses":["clearly"],"ipa":"/ˌklaɾaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-claramente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom está claramente agotado.","en":"Tom is clearly worn out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804254"},{"text":"Hable despacio y claramente.","en":"Speak slowly and clearly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524381"},{"text":"No estaba pensando claramente.","en":"I wasn't thinking clearly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515272"},{"text":"Tom está claramente decepcionado.","en":"Tom is clearly disappointed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306311"},{"text":"Tomás es claramente el ganador.","en":"Tom is clearly the winner.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519135"}]}